WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.331
At the Hotel.

2
00:00:01.611 --> 00:00:06.006
Day 31 of the Soft Skill Playbook course, in the Everyday Life phase.

3
00:00:07.756 --> 00:00:08.780
The key idea.

4
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.428
Polite + specific = fast service.

5
00:00:11.708 --> 00:00:14.183
Front-desk staff solve problems all day.

6
00:00:14.463 --> 00:00:16.020
Make yours easy to solve.

7
00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.223
Part 1.

8
00:00:18.503 --> 00:00:19.378
Check-in.

9
00:00:20.628 --> 00:00:21.993
Here is a quick table:

10
00:00:22.273 --> 00:00:23.617
They ask, and You say.

11
00:00:23.897 --> 00:00:25.412
Do you have a reservation?:

12
00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.551
Yes, under the name Ashish Gupta, for 3 nights.

13
00:00:28.831 --> 00:00:31.753
May I see your ID and a card for incidentals?:

14
00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:32.716
Sure.

15
00:00:32.996 --> 00:00:35.257
Is the deposit refundable at check-out?

16
00:00:35.537 --> 00:00:37.308
Would you like breakfast included?:

17
00:00:37.588 --> 00:00:39.273
How much extra is it per day?

18
00:00:40.623 --> 00:00:41.605
You can ask:

19
00:00:41.885 --> 00:00:43.485
Is early check-in possible?

20
00:00:43.765 --> 00:00:45.237
My flight landed early.

21
00:00:45.517 --> 00:00:46.861
What time is check-out?

22
00:00:47.141 --> 00:00:48.698
Is late check-out available?

23
00:00:48.978 --> 00:00:50.493
What's the Wi-Fi password?

24
00:00:50.773 --> 00:00:52.607
What time is breakfast, and where?

25
00:00:52.887 --> 00:00:56.130
Could I have a quiet room or high floor or away from the lift?

26
00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:57.861
Is there an airport shuttle?

27
00:00:58.141 --> 00:00:59.421
What time does it leave?

28
00:01:00.771 --> 00:01:03.928
Do you have a gym or laundry service or business centre?

29
00:01:04.208 --> 00:01:06.491
Can I leave my luggage here after check-out?

30
00:01:07.841 --> 00:01:08.715
Part 2.

31
00:01:08.995 --> 00:01:10.339
Problems with the room.

32
00:01:11.589 --> 00:01:12.528
You could say:

33
00:01:12.808 --> 00:01:14.920
Hi, this is room 512.

34
00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.037
The AC isn't cooling, and the room is quite warm.

35
00:01:18.317 --> 00:01:21.389
Could you send someone to check it, or move me to another room?

36
00:01:21.669 --> 00:01:22.501
Thank you.

37
00:01:23.851 --> 00:01:24.939
Other requests:

38
00:01:25.219 --> 00:01:27.545
Could I get extra towels or pillows, please?

39
00:01:27.825 --> 00:01:29.489
The hot water isn't working.

40
00:01:29.769 --> 00:01:31.774
There's a lot of noise from the next room.

41
00:01:32.054 --> 00:01:32.950
Could you help?

42
00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:36.643
I booked a non-smoking room, but this one smells of smoke.

43
00:01:37.993 --> 00:01:38.889
Part 3.

44
00:01:39.169 --> 00:01:40.065
Check-out.

45
00:01:41.315 --> 00:01:42.595
I'd like to check out.

46
00:01:42.875 --> 00:01:44.305
Room 512.

47
00:01:44.585 --> 00:01:46.249
Could I see an itemised bill?

48
00:01:46.529 --> 00:01:48.299
I don't think I used the minibar.

49
00:01:48.579 --> 00:01:53.379
Could you send the invoice to my email with my company's name and GST number?

50
00:01:53.659 --> 00:01:55.750
Could you call a cab to the airport, please?

51
00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.017
Part 4.

52
00:01:58.297 --> 00:01:59.727
Practice conversations.

53
00:02:00.977 --> 00:02:02.086
Checking in early.

54
00:02:02.366 --> 00:02:04.393
Here is how the conversation goes.

55
00:02:04.673 --> 00:02:06.827
Good morning, welcome to the Residency.

56
00:02:07.107 --> 00:02:08.366
How can I help you?

57
00:02:08.646 --> 00:02:09.734
Good morning.

58
00:02:10.014 --> 00:02:13.683
I have a reservation under Ashish Gupta for three nights.

59
00:02:13.963 --> 00:02:15.265
Yes, I have it.

60
00:02:15.545 --> 00:02:17.379
Check-in is at 2 pm, though.

61
00:02:17.659 --> 00:02:19.473
My flight landed early.

62
00:02:19.753 --> 00:02:21.694
Is early check-in possible?

63
00:02:23.044 --> 00:02:24.644
The conversation continues.

64
00:02:24.924 --> 00:02:26.033
Let me check...

65
00:02:26.313 --> 00:02:28.127
A room will be ready at 11.

66
00:02:28.407 --> 00:02:30.135
Would you like to leave your bags here?

67
00:02:30.415 --> 00:02:31.481
Yes, please.

68
00:02:31.761 --> 00:02:33.468
Is breakfast still available?

69
00:02:33.748 --> 00:02:37.161
Yes, until 10:30 in the restaurant on the first floor.

70
00:02:37.441 --> 00:02:38.188
Great.

71
00:02:38.468 --> 00:02:40.324
And what's the Wi-Fi password?

72
00:02:40.604 --> 00:02:41.863
It's on this card.

73
00:02:42.143 --> 00:02:44.191
Here's your key once the room is ready.

74
00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:46.927
A problem with the room.

75
00:02:47.207 --> 00:02:49.234
Here is how the conversation goes.

76
00:02:49.514 --> 00:02:51.839
Hi, this is room 512.

77
00:02:52.119 --> 00:02:55.618
The AC isn't cooling, and the room is very warm.

78
00:02:55.898 --> 00:02:56.965
I'm sorry.

79
00:02:57.245 --> 00:02:59.207
I'll send a technician right away.

80
00:02:59.487 --> 00:03:00.725
Twenty minutes later

81
00:03:01.005 --> 00:03:02.050
Hi again.

82
00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:06.618
The technician says the AC needs a part, and it can't be fixed today.

83
00:03:06.898 --> 00:03:08.178
I apologise.

84
00:03:08.458 --> 00:03:10.954
We can move you to another room on the 6th floor.

85
00:03:12.304 --> 00:03:13.904
The conversation continues.

86
00:03:14.184 --> 00:03:15.443
That would be great.

87
00:03:15.723 --> 00:03:17.472
Is it also non-smoking?

88
00:03:17.752 --> 00:03:18.883
Yes, it is.

89
00:03:19.163 --> 00:03:20.933
Someone will help you with your bags.

90
00:03:21.213 --> 00:03:22.152
Thank you.

91
00:03:22.432 --> 00:03:24.352
I appreciate the quick help.

92
00:03:25.702 --> 00:03:27.238
That's the end of this lesson.

93
00:03:27.518 --> 00:03:32.190
Pick one script from it, say it out loud three times, and use it for real today.

94
00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:38.571
For extra practice, paste the Master Prompt into an AI assistant and role-play the conversation.

